  "tax": "excluded; prices as published by each vendor on the checked date",
  "method": "Every figure was read from the vendor's own pricing page on the checked date, in a browser, with the billing toggle set to both the discounted term and the monthly term where the page offered one. No figure comes from a third-party review, a reseller, or an aggregator.",
